  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1)\n\nDry conditions are expected through Friday. An upper level low will\nbring showers and thunderstorms to the region over the weekend. There\nwill be the potential for some slow moving storms and heavy rain at\ntimes over the weekend. In addition cannot rule out an isolated\nstrong to severe storm on Saturday. There is uncertainty on how \nquickly this system moves out of the area. There will be the \npotential for off and on precipitation chances into the middle of \nnext week as well as the system meanders near the region.\n\nKEY MESSAGE 2)\n\nWith some WAA on Friday temperatures will be warmer and generally\naround the middle 80s. With cloud cover and precipitation over the\nweekend expect highs in the 70s to low 80s. There will be a gradual\nwarming trend next week with highs by the middle of next week in the\nmiddle to upper 80s.",
